{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2025-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1757289600, "end_date": 1757980799, "month_true_total": 168, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:55:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "204440075", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080498620", "personaname": "dethrox.lethon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198080498620/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 13479, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11438, "last_played": 1789511000, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It was close, very close indeed: But now, after the release of Borderlands 4 it is clear that Roboquest still has THE best gunplay of any fps. Its not like I have 200h in this game because its bad. I usually dont review games on steam, hardly anyone will read this, but if you do: I dont have any reason to lie, I wont gain anything from you buying this game, I paid (bought it on sale for 20% off, so 20€/$) for this game, I did not recieve a free copy. If you  decide to buy it, 1 minute in you will have realized I didnt lie about the gunplay.", "timestamp_created": 1757977699, "timestamp_updated": 1757977699, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 101, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.836588919162750244", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "204412140", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100359717", "personaname": "Zekauge", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198100359717/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1895, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 1440, "last_played": 1790721619, "avatar": "511ddc3493b94bfd465c1104ff3443e4baca271d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dare I say the best roguelite game ever. Turns adrenaline into a drug and youre only left want nothing but more.", "timestamp_created": 1757956708, "timestamp_updated": 1758573407, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204411375", "author": {"steamid": "76561198308085812", "personaname": "Soaravia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Soaravia/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 3389, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2680, "last_played": 1760757769, "avatar": "141030554a39aa4bd3ec75333e142c26094fb57f"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a borderlands roguelike.\n\nThat should be enough to sell you, but if not, here's other cool stuff:\n\nGreat visuals\nRuns smoothly, never really had any bugs or performance issues\nCRISPY sound design\nClean and satisfying gunplay\nGreat replay value\n\nThe difficulty balancing at higher levels isn't great, but I think it's a phenomenal game that deserves more love.", "timestamp_created": 1757956075, "timestamp_updated": 1757956075, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.563145339488983154", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204384893", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121277970", "personaname": "Pandoras Chains", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198121277970/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 329, "last_played": 1780664841, "avatar": "a73955f5d746e6e266b5170c2eed3047928ff0b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is what Borderlands wishes it could feel like", "timestamp_created": 1757926577, "timestamp_updated": 1757926577, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525899946689605713", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204348464", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002579015", "personaname": "Skydawne", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198002579015/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2839, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1679, "last_played": 1760127155, "avatar": "7fa33e189f2a9a28f877dcee96acf1cca3da5960"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't let the name of this game fool you, it is all but a generic game; Its one, if not thé, best 2-player coop games out there, given you like fast paced and well flowing action games. Try the demo!", "timestamp_created": 1757876548, "timestamp_updated": 1757876577, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.506172835826873779", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}